//
// ---- What each layer does (for reviewers) ----
// Config/Constants/ColumnSpec: sheet names, column indexes, reminder cadence,
//   business-hours guardrails — no hardcoded IDs.
// IdService + Backfill/Reset: CL/INV/PAY/LOG auto-increment + repair tools.
// ClientLifecycle/Lookup: create/rename client folders, XLOOKUP integrity.
// Invoice/Payment services + dialogs: create invoice, record payment,
//   SUMIF rollups, status derivations.
// AutomationTriggers + ReminderAction + GranularAutomation: daily scan,
//   pre-due/overdue/recurring scheduler, per-invoice toggles.
// GmailOwner/Notification + WhatsAppService/Config: send + threading +
//   failure logging that never breaks the batch.
// CommunicationLog/Logger/SheetUtils/Lock/SystemHealth: audit trail,
//   concurrency locks, health checks.
//
// ---- How to share safely later (desktop, 5 min) ----
// 1. On laptop, open Apps Script → Project Settings → copy script ID (not password).
// 2. `npm i -g @google/clasp && clasp login && clasp clone <SCRIPT_ID> && clasp pull`
//    (this downloads .gs/.html without copy-paste)
// 3. Replace IDs/tokens with PropertiesService.getScriptProperties().getProperty(...)
// 4. Commit sanitized copy here as Code.gs (or keep private + share Loom demo).
//
// DO NOT paste real IDs, tokens, passwords, or client PII.
